  "title": "Galanz Retro Refrigerators Recalled After Fires, Death Reported: What Consumers Need to Know",
  "summary": "More Than 120,000 Refrigerators Affected in Nationwide Safety Recall Thousands of consumers across the United States are being warned about a major refrigerator recall involving Galanz retro-style refrigerators after federal safety officials reported multiple fires connected to the appliances. The recall affects more than 120,000 units sold through major retailers, including Amazon and Home Depot stores nationwide. The recall was announced by the U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission (CPSC)",
